Hello Sugi,

there is documentation of a small subset of classes and methods that is aimed at developers wanting to exchange information between Java and R code: http://docs.renjin.org/en/latest/renjin-java-api-specification.html#renjin-java-api-specification

The (full) Java API documentation is not online, but you can generate it from the sources as explained in an earlier thread in this group, see https://groups.google.com/d/msg/renjin-dev/G3oI8Eo7a-8/f46S8RgZISwJ

Regards,

